 "result": "Tessel uses `DispatchingJinjaLoader`, defined at `src/tessel/templating.py:49`. It subclasses `jinja2.BaseLoader`.\n\n- **Search order:** `_iter_loaders` first tries the app's own `jinja_loader`, then each registered bundle's `jinja_loader` (via `app.iter_bundles()`). The first loader that doesn't raise `TemplateNotFound` wins.\n- **`list_templates()`:** returns the union of templates from the app and all bundles.\n- **`EXPLAIN_TEMPLATE_LOADING`:** when set, `_get_source_explained` tries every loader and logs each attempt through `debughelpers.explain_template_loading_attempts`.",
